    "special": {
      "value": "You can't select another dedication feat until you have gained two other feats from the herbalist archetype.\nLeads to: Endemic Herbs|APG, Expert Herbalism|APG, Fresh Ingredients|APG, Poultice Preparation|APG, Gravelands Herbalist|LOKL"
